as the rendering of a statement that does not exist.\\n6\\t\\n7\\t## Claims\\n8\\t\\n9\\t- bin/attavo\\n10\\t- schema/manifest.schema.json\\n11\\t- attavo.toml\\n12\\t- .attavo/bin/forge-attestation\\n13\\t- .github/workflows/ci.yml\\n14\\t- tests/test_doctor_sealed.py\\n15\\t- tests/test_doctor.py\\n16\\t\\n17\\t## Criteria\\n18\\t\\n19\\t- doctor-fails-on-an-unsealed-merge.sh: on a fixture tenant with two merged items whose [forge].attestation_command answers for one merge and not the other, attavo doctor --json fails proof every-attested-item-is-sealed naming item 2 and its merge sha, listing sealed and unsealed, and holds once the command answers for both\\n20\\t- doctor-fails-without-attestation-command.sh: a manifest with no [forge].attestation_command fails the proof naming the key, and the manifest schema declares the key\\n21\\t- the-proof-has-its-test.sh: a test named test_doctor_proof_six_fails_on_an_unsealed_merge exists under tests/, this repository's manifest names its attestation command, and .attavo/bin/forge-attestation is executable\\n22\\t\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"6a170d87-3d29-46e3-a1eb-69574ae98490\",\"uuid\":\"b597f155-6920-49e4-8849-81e64d4b97cd\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-17T19:39:22.736Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"file\":{\"filePath\":\"/Users/davidbean/Projects/attavo-worktree-158/attest/specs/158/spec.md\",\"content\":\"## Problem\\n\\n`attavo doctor` reported done on this repository on 2026-09-17 while none of its three traversals (#106, #148, #153) had a statement in the attestation store: `main` had classic protection and no merge queue, every merge was direct, the coherence workflow's `merge_group` trigger never fired, and proof two holds on the four stage records with the chain held without asking whether the merge was sealed. The store answers 404 for all three; the operator screen rendered the missing statements as `not read`.\\n\\nRetires: the doctor's `done` on an unattested traversal; `not read` as the rendering of a statement that does not exist.\\n\\n## Claims\\n\\n- bin/attavo\\n- schema/manifest.schema.json\\n- attavo.toml\\n- .attavo/bin/forge-attestation\\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml\\n- tests/test_doctor_sealed.py\\n- tests/test_doctor.py\\n\\n## Criteria\\n\\n- doctor-fails-on-an-unsealed-merge.sh: on a fixture tenant with two merged items whose [forge].attestation_command answers for one merge and not the other, attavo doctor --json fails proof every-attested-item-is-sealed naming item 2 and its merge sha, listing sealed and unsealed, and holds once the command answers for both\\n- doctor-fails-without-attestation-command.sh: a manifest with no [forge].attestation_command fails the proof naming the key, and the manifest schema declares the key\\n- the-proof-has-its-test.sh: a test named test_doctor_proof_six_fails_on_an_unsealed_merge exists under tests/, this repository's manifest names its attestation command, and .attavo/bin/forge-attestation is executable\\n\",\"numLines\":22,\"startLine\":1,\"totalLines\":22}}}\n+{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cf9aVPdKJQhmCaogWfUhG\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01D53dwLXn6YDHUTa2rPYZGa\",\"name\":\"Read\",\"input\":{\"file_path\":\"/Users/davidbean/Projects/attavo-worktree-158/attest/specs/158/criteria\"},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":1131,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":29701,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":1131},\"output_tokens\":20,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\"},\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"6a170d87-3d29-46e3-a1eb-69574ae98490\",\"uuid\":\"4e535c98-aee1-42e2-b03c-e45c7bdf7c77\",\"timestamp\":